# Loge: ASP smoke test

```elixir
root = Path.expand("..", __DIR__)

Mix.install([
  {:loge, path: Path.join(root, "loge"), override: true},
  {:loge_asp, path: Path.join(root, "loge_asp")},
  {:kino_loge, path: Path.join(root, "kino_loge")}
])
```

## Solving

Expected: **Satisfiable**, one model, `colour(1,red) colour(2,green) colour(3,blue)` or another
proper colouring.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo,
  "node(1..3). edge(1,2). edge(2,3). edge(1,3).\ncol(red; green; blue).\n1 { colour(N, C) : col(C) } 1 :- node(N).\n:- edge(X, Y), colour(X, C), colour(Y, C).\n#show colour/2.\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Models `0` enumerates all of them. Expected: **Satisfiable**, six models.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo,
  "node(1..3). edge(1,2). edge(2,3). edge(1,3).\ncol(red; green; blue).\n1 { colour(N, C) : col(C) } 1 :- node(N).\n:- edge(X, Y), colour(X, C), colour(Y, C).\n#show colour/2.\n",
  models: 0,
  time_limit: 10
)
```

An optimisation runs to its optimum when no model count is set. Expected: **Satisfiable**,
the last model `in(b)` and the raw output's result `OPTIMUM FOUND`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo,
  "item(a, 3). item(b, 1). item(c, 2).\n{ in(I) : item(I, _) }.\n:- not in(_).\n#minimize { W, I : in(I), item(I, W) }.\n#show in/1.\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Expected: **Unsatisfiable**, no models.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImFzcCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjpudWxsLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6ImEuXG46LSBhLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo, "a.\n:- a.\n", time_limit: 10)
```

Grounding this never ends. Expected: **Timeout** after two seconds; the lint gives up after ten.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImFzcCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjpudWxsLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoyfSwic291cmNlIjoibmF0KDApLlxubmF0KE4gKyAxKSA6LSBuYXQoTikuXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo, "nat(0).\nnat(N + 1) :- nat(N).\n", time_limit: 2)
```

## Linting

Expected: under the editor, a syntax error on line 2; evaluating raises `Loge.Error` with it.
Corrected to `b :- c, d.`, line 3 is reported instead: `X` is unsafe, with the position of `X`.
With `X` removed, `c` and `d` occur in no rule head (info).

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImFzcCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjpudWxsLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInNvdXJjZSI6ImEgOi0gYi5cbmIgOi0gYyBkLlxucChYKSA6LSBhLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo, "a :- b.\nb :- c d.\np(X) :- a.\n", time_limit: 10)
```
